<title>EGYPT: Egypt cotton prices unchanged from two weeks ago.</title>
<headline>Egypt cotton prices unchanged from two weeks ago.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Export prices for Egyptian cotton this week are unchanged from two weeks ago, the Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association (Alcotexa) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The prices in centilibres (valid until 2200 GMT November 23) are -</p>
<p>	     FG/EX    FG+1/4     FG     FG-1/4    G/FG    G+3/8</p>
<p> Giza 76   171.0    165.0    159.0    153.0    147.0    144.0</p>
<p> Giza 70   164.0    158.0    152.0    146.0    140.0    137.0</p>
<p> Giza 77   161.0    155.0    149.0    143.0    137.0    134.0</p>
<p> Giza 86   144.0    138.0    132.0    126.0    120.0    117.0</p>
<p> Giza 75   134.0    128.0    122.0    116.0    110.0    107.0</p>
<p> Giza 85   131.0    125.0    119.0    113.0    107.0    104.0</p>
<p> Giza 83   127.0    121.0    115.0    109.0    103.0    100.0</p>
<p> Giza 80   127.0    121.0    115.0    109.0    103.0    100.0</p>
<p>Note - FG/EX = fully good/excellent, G/FG = good/fully good</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
